/w8nj618\n\n触手シチュ参考：\nhttps://i.imgur.com/qGQc1BA.jpg\nhttps://imgur.com/a/I02AVSy\nhttps://i.imgur.com/OFYZJej.jpg\n\n添い寝シチュ参考：\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/83447323\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/55095444", "nc": 58, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@wochi17/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 715471, "client_id": 379001, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1231b1fd/requests/205450_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b45c278143b262c8dc2accb311895f23", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1231b1fd/requests/205450_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b45c278143b262c8dc2accb311895f23, https://si.imgix.net/1231b1fd/requests/205450_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f53b50fd032513fe3b74648be9539cb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1231b1fd/requests/205450_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c2880f1257c7fd886c23b59f97dc564 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1231b1fd/requests/205450_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5902320b3b51323f54f5c4f2b9ea7ad", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1231b1fd/requests/205450_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a5902320b3b51323f54f5c4f2b9ea7ad, https://si.imgix.net/1231b1fd/requests/205450_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e3556f586a5087e20d1b841500085ef9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1231b1fd/requests/205450_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f1e4112e4a1f38bea4b093cafb02d5c6 3x"}, "body": "こんにちはwochiさん、wochiさんにランスシリーズの魔人ワーグ(ランスⅩ仕様)を